Microsoft Visual C++ runtime libraries

The Windows engine includes these files of the Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable, unmodified,
as shipped in Ollama's Windows release (lib/ollama/vulkan): concrt140.dll, msvcp140.dll,
msvcp140_1.dll, msvcp140_2.dll, msvcp140_atomic_wait.dll, msvcp140_codecvt_ids.dll,
vccorlib140.dll, vcruntime140.dll, vcruntime140_1.dll and vcruntime140_threads.dll.

